                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="411 1408 411 1421 2179 1417 2181 1404 2177 1374 2064 1363 2062 1363 2017 1372 1991 1363 1989 1363 1987 1363 1907 1372 1888 1363 1886 1363 1884 1363 1882 1363 1848 1372 1823 1363 1821 1363 1819 1363 1817 1363 1815 1363 1799 1374 1662 1374 1637 1363 1635 1363 1633 1363 1631 1363 1629 1363 1613 1374 1412 1374 1386 1363 1384 1363 1382 1363 1380 1363 1378 1363 1363 1372 1339 1363 1337 1363 1335 1363 1239 1374 1180 1364 1179 1364 1177 1364 1153 1374 1112 1364 1110 1364 1108 1364 824 1374 724 1364 722 1364 720 1364 683 1374 605 1364 603 1364 601 1364 571 1374 530 1364 528 1364 526 1364 470 1374 434 1364 432 1364 430 1364 428 1364 426 1364 409 1372 411 1408"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="described by Nelson;¹ but with the Chukchee an exchange of wives leads, as"/>
                    </TextLine>

